{"step_index":57,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T07:53:32Z","input_tokens":2384,"cache_read_tokens":81257,"output_tokens":5204,"thinking":"Initial assessment shows distinct colors at the bottom of each column, indicating the need for a holding slot action. The first move must involve pushing one card to the holding slot to enable further matching. Specifically, the agent is verifying the specific actions to confirm the bottom colors for each column. The goal is to set the game state for a match.\n\n\nThe initial state results in immediate deadlock, confirming a game-over scenario with zero valid moves. Only pushing Purple from Column 2 to the slot creates a match and a valid path forward. The game structure requires a staged level design, starting with simpler color configurations for easier levels, and increasing complexity for later game levels to introduce strategic deadlocks.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Updated card sort prototype with 3 levels: Level 1 (Easy 2-color tutorial), Level 2 (Medium), and Level 3 (Hard 4-color with instant game over traps). Minimalist portrait layout with slot below Col 2.","UserFacing":true},"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    /* Mobile Felt Table Background */\n    .felt-surface {\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 25%, #196f3d 0%, #114b29 70%, #0a331c 100%);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n    }\n    /* Minimalist Pure-Color Card */\n    .color-card {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 72px;\n      height: 96px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);\n      box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n      transition: transform 0.16s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.16s ease;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .col-tap:hover .bottom-card {\n      transform: translateY(-3px);\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n    }\n    .slot-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);\n    }\n    /* Solitaire Empty Placeholder */\n    .card-placeholder {\n      width: 72px;\n      height: 96px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16);\n      box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n    }\n    @keyframes shake {\n      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n      20% { transform: translateX(-5px); }\n      40% { transform: translateX(5px); }\n      60% { transform: translateX(-3px); }\n      80% { transform: translateX(3px); }\n    }\n    .shake-anim {\n      animation: shake 0.25s ease-in-out;\n    }\n    @keyframes popClear {\n      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n      50% { transform: scale(1.08); opacity: 0.8; }\n      100% { transform: scale(0.7); opacity: 0; }\n    }\n    .clearing-anim {\n      animation: popClear 0.24s ease-out forwards;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-transparent text-white antialiased p-2 select-none flex justify-center\">\n\n  <!-- Mobile Portrait Container (360px width) -->\n  <div id=\"game-frame\" class=\"felt-surface w-[360px] rounded-3xl border-4 border-[#082313] p-4 text-white shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[580px] transition-colors duration-300\">\n\n    <!-- Minimalist Top Bar: Icons & Level Dots -->\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-2 pt-1 pb-3\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <button id=\"btn-undo\" onclick=\"undoMove()\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/35 hover:bg-black/50 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-sm disabled:opacity-30 active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"Undo\">\n          ↩\n        </button>\n        <button onclick=\"resetLevel()\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-black/35 hover:bg-black/50 border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"Reset\">\n          ⟳\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Minimalist Level Indicator Dots (Level 1, Level 2, Level 3) -->\n      <div id=\"level-dots\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <!-- Rendered via JS -->\n      </div>\n\n      <button onclick=\"nextLevel()\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80 hover:bg-yellow-500 text-black font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-xs active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"Next Level\">\n        ➔\n      </button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 3 Tableau Columns (Cards cascade down vertically) -->\n    <div id=\"columns-row\" class=\"flex justify-between items-start px-2 min-h-[320px]\">\n      <!-- Columns rendered via JS -->\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom Center Holding Slot (Directly below Column 2) -->\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center pb-2 pt-3\">\n      <div id=\"holding-slot-box\" onclick=\"onSlotClick()\" class=\"relative card-placeholder flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer transition-transform\">\n        <!-- Slot card or empty placeholder -->\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    // Pure vibrant minimalist colors (Red, Amber, Blue, Purple)\n    const COLORS = {\n      R: { hex: '#ef4444', border: '#b91c1c' }, // Red\n      Y: { hex: '#f59e0b', border: '#b45309' }, // Yellow/Amber\n      B: { hex: '#3b82f6', border: '#1d4ed8' }, // Blue\n      P: { hex: '#a855f7', border: '#7e22ce' }  // Purple\n    };\n\n    const LEVELS = [\n      // Level 1: DỄ (2 màu, chỉ 6 lá, nhẹ nhàng làm quen cơ chế gộp bài)\n      {\n        targetCount: 3,\n        columns: [\n          ['B', 'R'],\n          ['R', 'B'],\n          ['R', 'B']\n        ]\n      },\n      // Level 2: VỪA (3 màu, 9 lá, cần tính toán chuyển cột)\n      {\n        targetCount: 3,\n        columns: [\n          ['R', 'B', 'Y'],\n          ['B', 'R', 'B'],\n          ['Y', 'Y', 'R']\n        ]\n      },\n      // Level 3: KHÓ (4 màu, 12 lá sâu 4 tầng, bẫy 0 nước đi ngay nước 1)\n      {\n        targetCount: 3,\n        columns: [\n          ['Y', 'P', 'Y', 'B'],\n          ['B', 'B', 'R', 'P'],\n          ['P', 'R', 'Y', 'R']\n        ]\n      }\n    ];\n\n    let currentLevelIdx = 0;\n    let columns = [];\n    let holdingSlot = null;\n    let history = [];\n    let isAnimating = false;\n\n    function cloneState() {\n      return {\n        columns: columns.map(c => [...c]),\n        holdingSlot\n      };\n    }\n\n    function initLevel(idx) {\n      currentLevelIdx = idx;\n      const lvl = LEVELS[idx];\n      columns = lvl.columns.map(c => [...c]);\n      holdingSlot = null;\n      history = [];\n      isAnimating = false;\n\n      // Update dots\n      const dotsContainer = document.getElementById('level-dots');\n   